<title>
Scan Tool Utility Table
</title>
<ptxt>
SUZUKI scan tool has setting change function of combination meter as follows. For details of SUZUKI scan tool, refer to its Operator&apos;s Manual.
</ptxt>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
